(
    title: "Obelix",
    developer: Some("Suki Lee"),
    description: Some("Asterix charges at Roman legionaries: each one he hits turns white with fright and freezes on the spot. Obelix follows behind, dropping menhirs on the stunned soldiers to score — in Roman numerals, naturally — and the faster a soldier was moving when Asterix caught him, the more he is worth. Fail to finish a stunned soldier and he flares red with rage."),
